%% PeakGear Gen2 deployment and runtime topology
flowchart LR
  User[Demo user] --> App[PeakGear browser and Node API]

  subgraph OCI[OCI]
    TF[Terraform compute and dedicated ADB]
    Storage[Object Storage release ZIP and Iceberg data]
    ADB[(Autonomous Database PG schema)]
    GenAI[OCI Generative AI]
    Catalog[AI Data Catalog]
    Transforms[Data Transforms]
  end

  subgraph VM[Reusable Oracle Linux image]
    Bootstrap[Root first boot release service]
    Units[ADB wallet and load user services]
    Compose[Podman Compose]
    App
    PrivateAI[Private AI embeddings]
    NetSuite[(NetSuite Oracle CDC source)]
    Sources[Postgres and MySQL sources]
    GG[GoldenGate Studio and runtime]
    OSA[GoldenGate Stream Analytics with Kafka and Spark]
    Signals[Demand signal generator]
    Gravitino[Gravitino Iceberg REST]
  end

  TF --> VM
  TF --> ADB
  Storage -->|pinned URL and SHA-256| Bootstrap
  Bootstrap -->|verified init and ingestion payload| Units
  Units -->|PG schema, data, OCI GenAI profile| ADB
  Units --> Compose
  Compose --> App
  Compose --> PrivateAI
  Compose --> NetSuite
  Compose --> Sources
  Compose --> GG
  Compose --> OSA
  Compose --> Signals
  Compose --> Gravitino
  App -->|primary SQL and Select AI| ADB
  App -->|image and text embeddings| PrivateAI
  ADB -->|model requests| GenAI
  NetSuite -->|source changes| GG
  GG -->|CDC target| ADB
  Signals --> OSA
  OSA -->|bronze stream| ADB
  Gravitino -->|Iceberg warehouse| Storage
  Transforms --> ADB
  Transforms --> Gravitino
  Catalog --> ADB
